/bin/
# goreleaser's output tree (`just release-snapshot`, and the tagged release
# builds on CI). Build products, never committed.
/dist/
# The guest binaries `just build` copies in for //go:embed. Build products,
# never committed — but the directory itself has to exist with its .keep, or
# the embed pattern matches nothing and the CLI stops compiling on a fresh
# checkout (internal/guestbin/embed_darwin.go).
/internal/guestbin/bin/*
!/internal/guestbin/bin/.keep
*.test
*.swp
.DS_Store
.claude/
# NOTE: internal/bpf/*_bpfel.go and *_bpfel.o are GENERATED but COMMITTED
# (embedded bytecode; keeps the Mac side buildable without clang).
# A CLI built at the repo root (go build -o drawbridge ./cmd/drawbridge)
/drawbridge
/drawbridged
